            "review_title": "Review at Sky Zone Beer Garden",
            "review_text": "TP\nGreater Hobart, Australia55 contributions\n0\nAvoid at all costs !\nApr 2026 • Couples\nDodgy city! Do yourself a favour and skip it! The burgers were completely raw and couldn’t be eaten. We waited an hour for them and the place was not even a quarter full\nThe drinks were not drinkable. Felt like we were being served by the mafia. He was rude and bully like\nMost expensive meal we’ve had in a month and we did it even eat it! Awful experience\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 28, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
