            "review_text": "Daydream14723197664\n1 contribution\n0\nBad service\nJan 2024 • Friends\n- My friends and I went to the restaurant's address at: 8th Floor, Master Building, 43 Tran Cao Van, Ward 6, District 3, Ho Chi Minh City: personal experience is that the service after coming to the restaurant is very good. Too bad, we won't come back next time.\n- First: Tax calculation is calculated twice on the customer's payment bill. I saw this after asking the shop to issue an invoice\n- Second: When the shop provides information for customers to transfer money, they do not provide business account information but provide personal information.\n- Second: The shop issued invoices to the wrong address of the customer. Even though I provided my address information, the shop still issued invoices with incorrect information. After that, I responded and asked the shop to resolve the issue. but the shop was silent.\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten February 6, 2024",
